                            <comment id="14590796" author="moon" created="Wed, 17 Jun 2015 22:57:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi, Thanks for reporting the issue.&lt;br/&gt;
Could you see any exception in your interpreter spark log file? which is placed in logs/zeppelin-interpreter-spark-........log&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14625034" author="denspa" created="Mon, 13 Jul 2015 17:54:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Sorry, for the late reply. I didn&apos;t realize that I hadn&apos;t closed this yet. Thanks for the interpreter log tip. It turns out it the interpreter log had the issue as a kerberos error which, after some sleuthing, I could nail down to an upgrade of the CDH version.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
